  r3d:metadataStandard _:b39, _:b40, _:b41 ;
  r3d:remarks "Finnish Social Science Data Archive is covered by CESSDA Data Catalogue, fairdata.fi Etsin,finna.fi, research.fi, OpenAIRE and Data Citation Index. Metadata are harvestable in DDI Codebook, OAI Dublin Core, and EAD3 formats through OAI-PMH metadata server. Further information about accessing data: https://www.fsd.tuni.fi/en/data/downloading-and-using-data/." ;
